WEBVTT

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:39.289
Pazuzu, you ungrateful gargoyle!

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:43.293
I put you through college,
and this is how you repay me?

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.340
Let's get this gargoyle hunt on the road.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:52.886
Driving gloves, driving goggles,
driving thong. There.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.930
Uh, maybe I should drive.

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.641
You? A woman?

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.017
I'm trying to catch a monster,

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:01.353
not find the quickest route to the mall!

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.106
Let me just adjust the seat...

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:09.945
Whoa! Oh!

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:11.446
My God, he's going to do it.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:14.157
Everyone, seat belts to maximum buckling!

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.387
Pazuzu!

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.058
Oh, Pazuzu!

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:43.228
Hey, grandpa,
move your wrinkly old keister!

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:46.398
Shut up!

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:50.569
For Heaven's Gate, Professor
this ship can do 99% light speed.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:52.696
Why are we going 35 miles an hour?

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.032
Because we're in a hurry, that's why!

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.201
Plus, you have the high beams on.

00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:01.830
I can't quite read the sign.

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:09.296
Pazuzu!

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:12.257
Pazuzu!

00:02:22.851 --> 00:02:24.561
Yo, Captain Cataracts.

00:02:24.645 --> 00:02:25.896
What are we doing here?

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.356
Oh, it's 2:30.

00:02:27.439 --> 00:02:30.400
We can still catch
the early bird dinner special.

00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:32.611
Uh, aren't we looking for your gargoyle?

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.821
My wha...

00:02:35.531 --> 00:02:37.032
Hello, Mavis.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:39.618
Surprised to see me back again so soon?

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:40.869
Mavis is dead.

00:02:40.953 --> 00:02:45.374
I expect you'll want to see
my Angry, Crotchety Grandpa Discount Card.

00:02:46.124 --> 00:02:47.793
Sir, this card is expired.

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:49.837
But it's good for a lifetime.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.380
Well, yours expired.

00:02:51.713 --> 00:02:52.714
Ooh.

00:02:53.757 --> 00:02:55.008
Oh, Lord.

00:02:55.092 --> 00:02:57.719
Teeth do not belong
in your pants, Professor.

00:02:57.803 --> 00:02:59.596
Well, I can't keep them in my mouth.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.640
They're nuclear-powered!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.104
Ow! It bit my finger!

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.773
No! No! It's tasted human blood.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:15.821
Mm...

00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:17.447
Damn good meat.

00:03:24.638 --> 00:03:28.016
Professor, we've talked it over,
and everybody thinks you're too old.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.184
- Right on.
- Yep.

00:03:29.268 --> 00:03:31.186
We've decided to do the merciful thing

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.562
and have you youth-a-sized.

00:03:32.646 --> 00:03:34.439
Dear God, no!

00:03:34.523 --> 00:03:36.066
Oh, relax, Professor.

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:38.694
Youth-a-sizing
is a trendy new spa treatment.

00:03:38.777 --> 00:03:40.904
It's this season's shark cartilage enema.

00:03:40.988 --> 00:03:42.739
But I like being old.

00:03:42.823 --> 00:03:44.783
I don't have to talk to my parents,

00:03:44.866 --> 00:03:46.952
no one asks me to help move their stuff.

00:03:47.035 --> 00:03:50.831
I don't need to understand
today's edgy TV sitcoms...

00:03:50.914 --> 00:03:54.626
Okay, okay. We're not going to force you
until I finish this sentence.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:55.711
Get him!

00:03:57.838 --> 00:03:59.506
My thong!

00:04:10.392 --> 00:04:13.312
Hi, I'm Heather,
your personal youth-a-sizer.

00:04:13.395 --> 00:04:16.398
Let's get started with a nice
botulism treatment, shall we?

00:04:16.481 --> 00:04:17.816
Go to hell, Heather!

00:04:17.899 --> 00:04:19.610
Oh.

00:04:20.777 --> 00:04:25.073
In small doses, botulism toxin
tightens and tones the facial muscles

00:04:25.157 --> 00:04:28.452
instead of killing you
in the most horrible fashion imaginable.

00:04:32.581 --> 00:04:35.250
Give me back my floppy face.

00:04:35.917 --> 00:04:38.045
Oh! Whoo! Ooh!

00:04:38.128 --> 00:04:39.421
Careful with the giblets!

00:04:39.504 --> 00:04:42.716
Mm, you're still retaining a lot of grump
in these joints.

00:04:42.799 --> 00:04:43.800
More pressure.

00:04:46.011 --> 00:04:47.137
Aah...

00:04:50.557 --> 00:04:53.310
Since this is such a serious case of old,

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:55.479
we'll have to try our strongest treatment,

00:04:55.562 --> 00:04:58.899
a soothing, full-body bath
in searing hot tar.

00:05:00.651 --> 00:05:03.946
Sir, it's not necessary,
or wise, to be naked.

00:05:04.029 --> 00:05:07.491
You sound just like my tennis instructor.

00:05:11.119 --> 00:05:13.580
The tar blisters the age
right out of the body

00:05:13.664 --> 00:05:17.167
in what top scientists
suspect is a miracle.

00:05:19.711 --> 00:05:21.296
Oh, I don't have time for this!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.925
I have to go buy a single piece of fruit
with a coupon and then return it,

00:05:25.008 --> 00:05:28.095
making people wait behind me
while I complain!

00:05:28.178 --> 00:05:29.846
He still sounds sort of old.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:30.973
Sort of real old.

00:05:31.056 --> 00:05:33.225
Step aside, lady.

00:05:33.308 --> 00:05:34.810
Like everything else in life,

00:05:34.893 --> 00:05:38.230
pumping is just a primitive,
degenerate form of bending.

00:05:39.648 --> 00:05:42.317
Whoa! Whoo!

00:05:42.401 --> 00:05:43.610
Oh! Whoa!

00:05:43.694 --> 00:05:45.195
,

00:05:45.279 --> 00:05:47.823
Come on, Bender, pump harder! Harder!

00:05:47.906 --> 00:05:50.075
I'm trying as hard as I can.

00:05:50.158 --> 00:05:51.785
Harder, damn you!

00:06:14.516 --> 00:06:17.019
Well, that was an utter waste of time.

00:06:18.604 --> 00:06:20.606
Professor, it worked!

00:06:20.689 --> 00:06:22.816
You look young enough to be my father.

00:06:22.899 --> 00:06:24.151
Poodle spit!

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:28.989
53 years old?

00:06:30.157 --> 00:06:33.493
Now I'll need a fake ID to rent ultraporn.

00:06:33.577 --> 00:06:34.953
This is cool, Professor.

00:06:35.037 --> 00:06:36.580
We should go out and celebrate.

00:06:36.663 --> 00:06:38.165
- Oh, my God.
- Huh?

00:06:43.629 --> 00:06:48.425
Dear Lord, you've all reverted
to your childhood forms.

00:06:48.508 --> 00:06:52.679
Hooray, I'm a teenage heartthrob again!

00:06:57.309 --> 00:07:00.020
While I try to restore our normal ages

00:07:00.103 --> 00:07:04.691
I expect you all to go about your jobs
like responsible professionals.

00:07:07.861 --> 00:07:09.071
It wasn't me, Mr. F.

00:07:09.154 --> 00:07:10.197
It was Amy.

00:07:11.073 --> 00:07:13.200
- Stop it, Amy.
- You stink!

00:07:13.283 --> 00:07:14.743
You know you did it.

00:07:16.536 --> 00:07:19.164
Quiet! Quiet, I say!

00:07:22.167 --> 00:07:25.045
We're here to take my little stub
of a husband home.

00:07:25.128 --> 00:07:28.256
Hermes, say goodbye to Mr. Farnsworth.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.258
Goodbye, Mr. Dumbsworth.

00:07:32.052 --> 00:07:35.931
Hey, this is my chance
to spend time with my parents, too.

00:07:36.014 --> 00:07:37.975
But your parents are gross sewer mutants.

00:07:38.058 --> 00:07:39.059
Ow!

00:07:41.228 --> 00:07:43.188
When I was an orphan, I always wished

00:07:43.272 --> 00:07:45.357
I could grow up with my mom and dad.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.318
And now, thanks to being hurled
backwards in time...

00:07:48.402 --> 00:07:49.569
That's not what happened!

00:07:49.653 --> 00:07:51.530
Shut up and go live with your parents!

00:08:05.502 --> 00:08:07.546
It's going to be
totally awesome, Mom.

00:08:07.629 --> 00:08:08.755
You and me can bake

00:08:08.839 --> 00:08:11.341
and argue about my hairstyle
hiding my pretty face.

00:08:11.425 --> 00:08:12.968
And if some kid picks on me,

00:08:13.051 --> 00:08:15.053
my dad can beat up his dad!

00:08:15.137 --> 00:08:16.596
Can't I just beat up the kid?

00:08:18.598 --> 00:08:21.018
Well, okay, Leela.

00:08:21.101 --> 00:08:23.145
If you think you can put up
with your father,

00:08:23.228 --> 00:08:24.229
then welcome home.

00:08:24.313 --> 00:08:26.690
We'll try to respect
your independence and freedom.

00:08:26.773 --> 00:08:29.985
No! I want the real teen experience.

00:08:30.068 --> 00:08:32.446
Chores, curfew, the works!

00:08:32.529 --> 00:08:36.283
Fine, sweetiekins.
We'll be the strictest parents ever.

00:08:36.366 --> 00:08:38.952
Now, let's all have some tequila
to celebrate.

00:08:39.036 --> 00:08:41.038
Dad! I'm underage!

00:08:41.121 --> 00:08:42.205
Oh, right.

00:08:42.289 --> 00:08:43.624
Here's a Silly Straw.

00:08:48.587 --> 00:08:52.007
Oh, my Amy is sweet little girl again.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.843
This like a mother's dream.

00:08:54.926 --> 00:08:56.178
Bad dream, that is.

00:08:56.261 --> 00:08:58.889
At this rate, I'm never going to get
a grandchild! Ugh!

00:08:58.972 --> 00:09:01.266
Maybe she not grown up,
but she sure grown out.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.434
She fat.

00:09:02.517 --> 00:09:05.729
Dad, if you're going to make
fat jokes till I get cute again,

00:09:05.812 --> 00:09:07.648
I'm just going to stay in my room.

00:09:07.731 --> 00:09:10.817
Stay in room? You so fat,
you going to stay all around room.

00:09:15.906 --> 00:09:19.493
I've got to find a way to escape
the horrible ravages of youth.

00:09:19.576 --> 00:09:22.287
Suddenly, I'm going to the
bathroom like clockwork

00:09:22.371 --> 00:09:23.622
every three hours.

00:09:23.705 --> 00:09:27.250
And those jerks at Social Security
stopped sending me checks.

00:09:27.334 --> 00:09:29.503
Now I have to pay them!

00:09:29.586 --> 00:09:31.338
I'm tired of your yapping!

00:09:35.592 --> 00:09:37.052
All you ever do is complain.

00:09:37.135 --> 00:09:39.054
You never try to make things better.

00:09:39.137 --> 00:09:42.474
Well, I'm running away
from this dead-end family.

00:09:42.557 --> 00:09:46.436
I know there's a place for
people like me, with new ideas.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.604
There has to be!

00:09:47.688 --> 00:09:48.981
Fine. Get going.

00:09:49.064 --> 00:09:50.482
Oh, I'm going.

00:09:50.565 --> 00:09:52.276
And you're going to be all,
"Where's Bender?

00:09:52.359 --> 00:09:53.694
"I miss Bender."

00:09:53.777 --> 00:09:55.779
We won't know that until you leave.

00:09:55.862 --> 00:09:57.281
Oh, I'm leaving.

00:09:57.364 --> 00:09:59.199
There's the door.

00:10:01.034 --> 00:10:02.536
I'll be good.

00:10:06.748 --> 00:10:09.251
Do you have to shed
your skin on the couch?

00:10:09.334 --> 00:10:10.585
What do we live in, a zoo?

00:10:11.795 --> 00:10:13.046
I'm getting the doorbell.

00:10:14.506 --> 00:10:15.507
For me?

00:10:16.883 --> 00:10:18.176
Oh, hello, sir.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.429
It's a lovely evening you have tonight.

00:10:20.512 --> 00:10:22.723
Um, I'm here to pick up your daughter.

00:10:22.806 --> 00:10:24.016
Hi, Fry.

00:10:24.099 --> 00:10:25.851
I like your blazer.

00:10:25.934 --> 00:10:28.645
Thanks. These aren't pockets,
they're just flaps.

00:10:28.729 --> 00:10:30.522
I put my money in my sock.

00:10:32.774 --> 00:10:35.110
So, where are you taking my
daughter tonight?

00:10:35.193 --> 00:10:36.278
A movie.

00:10:36.361 --> 00:10:38.071
A... A movie, ma'am.

00:10:39.323 --> 00:10:40.824
Well, whatever you're really doing,

00:10:40.907 --> 00:10:43.076
don't wake us if you get in after 12:00.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.829
Dad! You're being too lenient again.

00:10:45.912 --> 00:10:47.664
I have to be back by 11:00.

00:10:47.748 --> 00:10:50.167
Okay, Okay. You're the boss.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.710
No, I'm not!

00:10:56.798 --> 00:10:59.551
I'd like a sewer burger,
but without the rat feces.

00:10:59.635 --> 00:11:00.719
What, are you on a diet?

00:11:03.055 --> 00:11:05.682
Duh, Leela, you look hot.

00:11:05.766 --> 00:11:09.311
Geez, Moose, just dump me
right in front of her, why don't you?

00:11:09.394 --> 00:11:12.689
Moose, Mandy, this is my friend Fry,

00:11:12.773 --> 00:11:14.024
from the surface?

00:11:14.107 --> 00:11:16.777
Oh, so this is the famous Fry.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.071
What is he, like,
the biggest loser on the surface

00:11:19.154 --> 00:11:20.864
so he has to hang out in the sewer?

00:11:20.948 --> 00:11:22.032
They're on to me.

00:11:22.115 --> 00:11:23.116
Hey, come on.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.036
Let's act like grown-ups here.
Want to race?

00:11:26.119 --> 00:11:27.663
Duh, yeah.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.141
Theres.

00:11:48.225 --> 00:11:51.561
The world's drinkings water
is safes for another days.

00:11:52.312 --> 00:11:54.231
Whoas! Cripe!

00:12:05.075 --> 00:12:06.827
Watch out, Fry!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.748
We missed the turn!
We'll never catch them!

00:12:11.832 --> 00:12:12.833
Yes, we will!

00:12:12.916 --> 00:12:15.043
This sewer goes right under Planet Express

00:12:15.127 --> 00:12:16.461
and it's 9:00 p.m.!

00:12:18.547 --> 00:12:21.550
The devil take this predictable colon!

00:12:31.226 --> 00:12:32.227
Whoo-hoo!

00:12:32.311 --> 00:12:33.687
Whoo-hoo! All right!

00:12:34.479 --> 00:12:36.815
Leela, you can stop winning now. We won.

00:12:36.898 --> 00:12:38.734
I'm too short to reach the hand brake!

00:12:43.196 --> 00:12:44.573
That's detention.

00:12:47.409 --> 00:12:50.203
And then, and then a giant tapeworm
tried to play us for chumps!

00:12:50.287 --> 00:12:52.122
But we, like, totally dissed Moose.

00:12:52.205 --> 00:12:55.375
Yes, I'd like to meet this "Moose."

00:12:55.459 --> 00:12:57.878
But in the meantime, I have good news.

00:12:57.961 --> 00:13:00.255
I may have solved our age problem.

00:13:00.339 --> 00:13:01.423
Yay!

00:13:02.841 --> 00:13:05.719
It seems the youth-a-sizing tar
was saturated

00:13:05.802 --> 00:13:07.804
with time-altering chronitons.

00:13:07.888 --> 00:13:10.766
A thin layer is still stuck to our DNA

00:13:10.849 --> 00:13:14.436
as well as Bender's "Robo," or "RNA."

00:13:14.519 --> 00:13:15.896
- Question?
- Yes?

00:13:15.979 --> 00:13:17.856
You stink.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:21.902
Yes, yes. Anyhow, I've designed
an oil-eating bacterium

00:13:21.985 --> 00:13:24.613
that should take the tar right off.

00:13:24.696 --> 00:13:27.574
Come on, let's go tell Leela
so we can grow up together.

00:13:30.911 --> 00:13:33.455
Thanks, Professor,
but I don't want the treatment.

00:13:33.538 --> 00:13:35.749
Don't you understand, you little nitwit?

00:13:35.832 --> 00:13:37.376
Unless you're treated soon,

00:13:37.459 --> 00:13:41.505
the only way to restore your true age
will be to grow into it,

00:13:41.588 --> 00:13:43.674
just as God intended!

00:13:43.757 --> 00:13:45.300
He has a point, honey.

00:13:45.384 --> 00:13:47.552
What about your job and your friends?

00:13:47.636 --> 00:13:50.472
Do you really want to
abandon your old life?

00:13:50.555 --> 00:13:53.976
My old life wasn't as glamorous
as my Web page made it look.

00:13:54.059 --> 00:13:57.229
All I ever wanted
was to grow up here, with you.

00:13:57.312 --> 00:13:58.689
Please?

00:13:58.772 --> 00:14:01.650
Well, if it's what you really want...

00:14:01.733 --> 00:14:03.527
It is. I know it is.

00:14:06.071 --> 00:14:07.948
I'll miss you, Leela.

00:14:08.031 --> 00:14:10.409
I'll come back and visit
when I'm all grown up.

00:14:11.451 --> 00:14:12.577
Bring beer.

00:14:12.661 --> 00:14:14.830
No beer till you finish your tequila.

00:14:16.039 --> 00:14:18.917
The age-restoring microbes are ready.

00:14:19.001 --> 00:14:22.004
Everyone into the Bacterial Spew Chamber.

00:14:22.087 --> 00:14:23.588
Let's go!

00:14:23.672 --> 00:14:26.383
Yes, everyone do the same thing.

00:14:28.343 --> 00:14:31.555
Initiating controlled infection.

00:14:34.433 --> 00:14:35.851
Aah-choo!

00:14:37.436 --> 00:14:38.562
I'm no doctor,

00:14:38.645 --> 00:14:40.564
but this machine guy could use a lozenge.

00:14:45.902 --> 00:14:47.237
Aw, poo.

00:14:47.321 --> 00:14:48.822
We're even younger.

00:14:53.827 --> 00:14:56.747
Damn! The bacteria pigged out on the tar

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.915
and now they're getting freaky-deaky,

00:14:58.999 --> 00:15:01.710
spreading chronitons
throughout our systems.

00:15:01.793 --> 00:15:03.420
We're getting younger by the minute!

00:15:03.503 --> 00:15:04.796
- No!
- Yikes!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.091
What, I'm going to revert
through all my larval stages?

00:15:09.134 --> 00:15:12.554
Word. We'll all keep getting
younger and younger

00:15:12.638 --> 00:15:15.932
until we suffer a fate worse than death,

00:15:16.016 --> 00:15:17.017
pre-life!

00:15:17.517 --> 00:15:18.518
Then, death.

00:15:33.075 --> 00:15:35.118
I've got to stop this reverse aging

00:15:35.202 --> 00:15:38.956
before we all shrivel up
and suffer the agony of unbirth!

00:15:39.039 --> 00:15:41.458
Think, you disco duck, think!

00:15:41.541 --> 00:15:43.585
What's that squirmle under your shirt?

00:15:43.669 --> 00:15:48.131
Oh, get off me, you parasitic lamprey!

00:15:48.215 --> 00:15:51.009
Oh, sure, you need all your blood.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.264
Would you all chill?

00:15:56.348 --> 00:15:59.559
I can't think with you kids
cramping my style!

00:15:59.643 --> 00:16:02.020
Ooh, I need a babysitter.

00:16:02.771 --> 00:16:04.940
Okay, quiet time.

00:16:07.317 --> 00:16:08.318
I know.

00:16:08.402 --> 00:16:10.654
Everyone pretend a goblin ate your tongues

00:16:10.737 --> 00:16:12.030
and I'll read you a story.

00:16:12.114 --> 00:16:14.533
- Ooh, story!
- A story!

00:16:14.616 --> 00:16:16.618
I can't see from down here, I can't.

00:16:18.328 --> 00:16:19.705
There.

00:16:19.788 --> 00:16:22.124
Today's story is from Muteen magazine.

00:16:22.207 --> 00:16:23.667
Who would you rather hear about?

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.128
Four-legged Chachi or tentacle Chachi?

00:16:26.211 --> 00:16:28.672
I wanna hear a space story.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:33.510
It's kind of a baby book,
but okay, let's see.

00:16:33.593 --> 00:16:36.722
"Snow White Dwarf
and the Seven Red Dwarfs"

00:16:36.805 --> 00:16:38.473
"Charlotte's Tholian Web"

00:16:38.557 --> 00:16:40.434
"The Fountain of Aging."

00:16:42.894 --> 00:16:44.479
The Fountain of Aging?

00:16:44.563 --> 00:16:47.149
Hmm, it is just a legend.

00:16:47.232 --> 00:16:49.693
Still, they called
the Tooth Fairy a legend

00:16:49.776 --> 00:16:52.112
and now he's head of the FBI.

00:16:54.698 --> 00:16:56.033
'Sup? Kids ready?

00:16:56.116 --> 00:16:59.119
Yay, Professy's back!

00:16:59.202 --> 00:17:02.414
Ew, you smell like smoking...

00:17:02.497 --> 00:17:04.291
And drinking.

00:17:04.374 --> 00:17:07.461
I had a few beers, but I'm cool to drive.

00:17:07.544 --> 00:17:09.963
I wish I could come with you
to say goodbye

00:17:10.047 --> 00:17:12.382
before you all turn back into grown-ups.

00:17:12.466 --> 00:17:15.093
But I'm grounded
for knocking the school over.

00:17:15.177 --> 00:17:16.595
Who cares, Leela?

00:17:16.678 --> 00:17:18.472
It was just a public school.

00:17:18.555 --> 00:17:20.557
Now, go with your friends, please.

00:17:20.641 --> 00:17:24.478
No! A grounded teenager
must be confined to her room!

00:17:25.646 --> 00:17:27.230
Until she sneaks out.

00:17:32.361 --> 00:17:35.030
When I grow up,
I wanna be a steam shovel.

00:17:39.868 --> 00:17:42.079
According to this, the fountain is located

00:17:42.162 --> 00:17:44.873
in the darkest,
most ancient region of space,

00:17:44.957 --> 00:17:46.875
just past Teddy Bear Junction.

00:17:46.959 --> 00:17:48.627
Teddy Bear Junction,

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:51.254
the worst scum hole in the galaxy.

00:17:54.758 --> 00:17:57.761
This solar system is, like, way old!

00:17:57.844 --> 00:18:00.889
Look how high the asteroid belt
is pulled up on that planet.

00:18:00.973 --> 00:18:02.224
News flash!

00:18:02.307 --> 00:18:03.475
Everything's getting older

00:18:03.558 --> 00:18:06.436
the closer we get
to that ancient burnt-out sun.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.274
Dude! The Fountain of Aging
must be on the sun itself!

00:18:10.357 --> 00:18:12.442
Shut up! I was gonna say that.

00:18:25.998 --> 00:18:27.165
We've got to hurry.

00:18:27.249 --> 00:18:29.376
The kids have only one change of pants!

00:18:34.047 --> 00:18:37.551
We gotta be real, real careful to stay in

00:18:37.634 --> 00:18:40.637
just long enough to make us
our right ages again.

00:18:40.721 --> 00:18:42.472
Whee!

00:18:44.349 --> 00:18:46.351
Zoidberg, get out of there!

00:18:46.435 --> 00:18:50.606
The current! It's too much already! Help!

00:18:55.944 --> 00:18:57.070
Jeepers.

00:18:57.154 --> 00:18:58.488
Zoidberg is dead!

00:18:58.572 --> 00:19:01.325
No, Zoidberg's brother is dead.

00:19:01.408 --> 00:19:04.077
Funny story, I just reverted to the age

00:19:04.161 --> 00:19:05.912
when my siblings budded from me

00:19:05.996 --> 00:19:09.291
and my brother Norman split off
and jumped in the fountain.

00:19:09.374 --> 00:19:12.210
He always had to be
the center of attention!

00:19:12.294 --> 00:19:15.005
- Good riddance!
- Let him go!

00:19:15.672 --> 00:19:16.673
Oh, no!

00:19:22.471 --> 00:19:24.681
Quick! Get them into the fountain!

00:19:27.517 --> 00:19:29.645
Thanks for the help, Weewa.

00:19:29.728 --> 00:19:33.607
Once we're growed up,
you can go back to your famwy.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.026
We'll never bother you again.

00:19:36.652 --> 00:19:38.528
Well, you could bother me a little.

00:19:40.614 --> 00:19:42.074
Ooh... Oh!

00:19:42.157 --> 00:19:44.201
It's working! Hooray!

00:19:44.284 --> 00:19:46.119
I can't hold on!

00:19:49.581 --> 00:19:51.333
I'm coming in after you!

00:19:51.416 --> 00:19:52.417
No, Leela!

00:19:52.501 --> 00:19:54.461
You can't give you up your childhood!

00:19:54.544 --> 00:19:56.838
You'll never have another chance at it!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.534
We did it! We're the right ages again.

00:20:25.617 --> 00:20:27.786
I think I might be a couple years younger!

00:20:27.869 --> 00:20:29.746
Oh, me, too!

00:20:30.289 --> 00:20:33.000
Help!

00:20:33.083 --> 00:20:36.628
I'm still in mid-peril, you clods!

00:20:36.712 --> 00:20:38.964
He's too far out! We can't reach him!

00:20:39.047 --> 00:20:43.343
With my last breath, I curse Zoidberg!

00:20:58.692 --> 00:20:59.943
Pazuzu!

00:21:00.027 --> 00:21:02.821
Oh, you came back to me!

00:21:05.907 --> 00:21:08.285
Are you back to your original age,
Professor?

00:21:11.788 --> 00:21:12.873
Even older!

00:21:12.956 --> 00:21:14.958
Huzzah!

00:21:15.334 --> 00:21:17.836
I'm sorry you had to give up
being a kid, Leela.

00:21:17.919 --> 00:21:22.049
Well, I guess every adult wants
to be a kid again sometimes

00:21:22.132 --> 00:21:24.259
but I worked hard to be the person I am.

00:21:24.343 --> 00:21:25.510
The fabulous person!

00:21:25.594 --> 00:21:27.220
With friends like you guys...

00:21:27.304 --> 00:21:28.430
Fabulous friends!

00:21:28.513 --> 00:21:31.975
Mm. And I'm really happy
I have that life back.

00:21:33.101 --> 00:21:35.312
And you, my faithful fiend,

00:21:35.395 --> 00:21:37.981
how can I ever repay you?

00:21:39.483 --> 00:21:41.151
And that, little one,

00:21:41.234 --> 00:21:43.779
is how Papa gain his freedom.

00:21:43.862 --> 00:21:46.323
Now, bonne nuit.

00:21:46.406 --> 00:21:49.117
Bonne nuit to you all.